@section Styles {
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>常見問題</title>
    
    <style>
        .main_1 {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 400px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .image-container_1 {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 400px;
        }

        .module-image_1 {
            width: 100%;
            height: 400px;
            object-fit: cover;
            opacity: 0.5; /* 使圖片刷淡 */
        }

        .title {
            position: absolute;
            top: 50%;
            left: 10%;
            transform: translateY(-50%);
            color: white;
            font-size: 3em;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5)
        }
    </style>
}
<div>
    <div class="main_1">
        <section class="module_1">
            <div class="image-container_1">
                <img src="~/style/img/fqa.jpg" class="module-image_1" />
                <h1 class="title">常見問題 </br>&amp; 歡迎聯絡我們</h1>
            </div>
        </section>
    </div>

    <section class="module">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                    <h4 class="font-alt mb-0">常見問題</h4>
                    <hr class="divider-w mt-10 mb-20">
                    <div class="panel-group" id="accordion">
                        <!-- 問題1 -->
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading">
                                <h4 class="panel-title font-alt">
                                    <a data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion" href="#support1">請問保母服務的地區有哪些？</a>
                                </h4>
                            </div>
                            <div class="panel-collapse collapse show" id="support1">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    我們專業的保母在全台各地都有提供服務。
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- 問題2 -->
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading">
                                <h4 class="panel-title font-alt">
                                    <a class="collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion" href="#support2">請問我立即需要保母怎麼辦？</a>
                                </h4>
                            </div>
                            <div class="panel-collapse collapse" id="support2">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    如果您的家人需要立即照顧援助，貝比巧育可以為您提供優秀的臨時保母，為您提供保障和安心。貝比巧育擁有一個由專業保母團隊，我們不斷物色和嚴格審查加入我們的潛在專業保母。
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- 問題3 -->
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading">
                                <h4 class="panel-title font-alt">
                                    <a class="collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion" href="#support3">聘請保母需要注意哪些事項？</a>
                                </h4>
                            </div>
                            <div class="panel-collapse collapse" id="support3">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    僱用專業保姆時需要考慮很多事情。您在尋找什麼職位？您想要全職保母還是兼職保母？您在找住家保母還是住外保母？您還應該考慮您希望保姆擁有甚麼樣的品質和特徵。你希望他們有什麼經驗？哪種性格最適合您和家人的個性？
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- 問題4 -->
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading">
                                <h4 class="panel-title font-alt">
                                    <a class="collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion" href="#support4">如何找到我所在地區的好保母？</a>
                                </h4>
                            </div>
                            <div class="panel-collapse collapse" id="support4">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    貝比巧育為您先一步進行廣泛的訪談、審查、背景調查和性格調查——如此一來您就可以減少篩選的時間。我們了解尋找合適的職業保姆需要投入大量時間和精力，因此我們為您確保所有專業保姆在與您的家人匹配之前都完全合格。
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- 問題5 -->
                        <div class="panel panel-default">
                            <div class="panel-heading">
                                <h4 class="panel-title font-alt">
                                    <a class="collapsed" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-parent="#accordion" href="#support5">如何聘請一位好的保母？</a>
                                </h4>
                            </div>
                            <div class="panel-collapse collapse" id="support5">
                                <div class="panel-body">
                                    每個人的看法都不同。家庭的需求差異很大。所以，一個家庭的好保母不一定對另一個家庭有好處。

                                    經驗豐富的職業保母有至少 3 年的家庭工作經驗或在正規日託或學校環境中工作過。專業保母接受過幼兒教育或訓練。

                                    他們是前瞻性的思想家。他們幾乎不需要指導或幫助。他們為孩子們計劃了活動。專業保母與家長進行有效溝通。他們可靠、準時，能夠幫助家庭順利運作。每個家庭都有獨特的需求，因此向我們傳達您家人眼中的「好」保姆是什麼樣子很重要。
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- Header Start -->
<div class="main_1">
    <section class="module_1">
        <div class="image-container_1">
            <img src="~/style/img/fqa2.jpg" class="module-image_1" />
            <h1 class="title">聯絡我們</h1>
        </div>
    </section>
</div>
<!-- Header End -->

<!-- Contact Start -->
<div class="container-fluid bg-light py-5 " id="newAPP">
    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="contact p-5">
            <div class="row g-4">
                <div class="col-xl-5">
                    <h1 class="mb-4">請填寫表單</h1>
                    <form v-on:submit.prevent="submitForm">
                        <div class="row gx-4 gy-3">
                            <div class="col-xl-6">
                                <input type="text" class="form-control bg-white border-0 py-3 px-4" placeholder="帳號" v-model="customerService.accountUserAccount">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-xl-6">
                                <input type="email" class="form-control bg-white border-0 py-3 px-4" placeholder="E-mail" v-model="customerService.email">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-xl-6">
                                <input type="text" class="form-control bg-white border-0 py-3 px-4" placeholder="連絡電話" v-model="customerService.phone">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-xl-6">
                                <input type="text" class="form-control bg-white border-0 py-3 px-4" placeholder="主題" v-model="customerService.title">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <textarea class="form-control bg-white border-0 py-3 px-4" rows="7" cols="10" placeholder="內容" v-model="customerService.context"></textarea>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <button class="btn-hover-bg btn btn-primary w-100 py-3 px-5" type="submit">送出</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
                <div class="col-xl-7">
                    <div>
                        <div class="row g-4">
                            <div class="col-lg-4">
                                <div class="bg-white p-4">
                                    <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt fa-2x text-primary mb-2"></i>
                                    <h4>地址</h4>
                                    <p class="mb-0">高雄市新興區</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-4">
                                <div class="bg-white p-4">
                                    <i class="fas fa-envelope fa-2x text-primary mb-2"></i>
                                    <h4>E-mail</h4>
                                    <p class="mb-0">info@example.com</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-4">
                                <div class="bg-white p-4">
                                    <i class="fa fa-phone fa-2x text-primary mb-2"></i>
                                    <h4>電話</h4>
                                    <p class="mb-0">(+886) 7 123 1123</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-lg-12">
                                <iframe class="w-100" style="height: 412px; margin-bottom: -6px;" src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m12!1m3!1d674.7425724581295!2d120.29302336746046!3d22.627996272774645!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!5e0!3m2!1szh-TW!2stw!4v1717867806284!5m2!1szh-TW!2stw"
                                        loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<!-- Contact End -->
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/vue@3.2.0/dist/vue.global.prod.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/axios/1.7.2/axios.min.js" integrity="sha512-JSCFHhKDilTRRXe9ak/FJ28dcpOJxzQaCd3Xg8MyF6XFjODhy/YMCM8HW0TFDckNHWUewW+kfvhin43hKtJxAw==" crossorigin="anonymous" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"></script>
    <script>
        const { createApp } = Vue;

        createApp({
            data() {
                return {
                    customerService: {
                        userName: '',
                        phone: '',
                        email: '',
                        title: '',
                        context: '',
                        type: '',
                        statement: '',
                        accountUserAccount: ''
                    }
                };
            },
            methods: {
                submitForm() {
                    
                    // 提交表單資料
                    console.log('提交表單...');
                    axios.post('https://localhost:7292/api/CustomerService', this.customerService)
                        .then(response => {
                            console.log('表單提交成功', response.data);
                            alert('表單提交成功');
                            this.resetForm();
                        })
                        .catch(error => {
                            console.error('表單提交失敗', error);
                            alert('表單提交失敗，請稍後再試');
                        });
                },
                resetForm() {
                    // 重置表單
                    this.customerService = {
                        userName: '',
                        phone: '',
                        email: '',
                        title: '',
                        context: '',
                        type: '',
                        statement: '',
                        accountUserAccount: ''
                    };
                }
            }
        }).mount('#newAPP');
    </script>
    
